Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is broad, spanning presidential transcripts and reports, ASF audits, SCJN/INAI records, legislative documents, international assessments, civil-society investigations, and national/international journalism. The strongest source families concern transparency and INAI paralysis, Segalmex procurement and accountability, family-linked business allegations, official responses, appointments, public promises, and investigations into obstruction or concealment. Several candidates are allegations or partisan accounts and require later inspection and triangulation.

